Stack:
------
=> LIFO 
4 opertations=>push, pop, peek, isempty
~~PUSH:
-> stack ->last(rear), first(front)
-> no top : top = 0
-> Increment the top for adding the next element. => top++
-> append => starts adding on the top of the stack.
-> pop => remove the element and decrement the top value.
-> peek: directly display the top elements without poping any other elements.=> ::-1
-> isempty: to check if stack is empty. => stack length = 0
==> REAL TIME APPLICATIONS: browser

